--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- chain in a two-train sea (JONSWAP wind sea plus crossing swell), 300 s
-- Same held-fairlead studless chain as dynamic_chain_waves.dat (50 m depth). Two wavetrain rows
-- add up to one crossing sea: a short-crested JONSWAP wind sea (Hs = 3.0 m, Tp = 7.0 s,
-- gamma = 3.3) along the line (0 deg) with cos-2s spreading s = 6, and a long-crested swell
-- (Hs = 2.0 m, Tp = 14.0 s, gamma = 5.0) from 60 deg (s = 0). Each train has its own heading,
-- spreading, and random phases (train i uses WaveSeed + 7919 (i - 1)). The waves row stays none:
-- wavetrain rows replace it. rampTime ramps the wave amplitudes in over the first 20 s.
